{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ♡\n気持ちいね...\n武道館って 気持ちいいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーだよー。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/12/08/9922629/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館でも，『1.2.3.4.GOー☆ろってぃー』ばっっっちり聞こえたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかさ♡  「どこまで聞こえんのー(´∀｀)」って位だったよぉ。\n嬉しかった、本当にありがとう♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ前の最高の声出しですね‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして昨日のLIVEはとんでもなく熱い熱いLIVEだった．最高でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもさ。。。\n明日のLIVEはもっとヤバいLIVEになるんじゃないかな？って、、\nアンダー初、ぃゃ、乃木坂初の何かが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁさ♡ まだ秘密だけどーーーー╰(*´︶`*)╯♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そーだ、ファンの方達にアドバイスをもらったもんだから言うねー、私のサイリウムカラーは『赤×白』だよーー(´∀｀)(´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくねぇ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/12/08/9922629/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もよろしくね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/12/08/9922629/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}